Malis goes to the sports club on Saturday. She puts her team shirt in her kit bag. She hits the shuttlecock over the net with her badminton racket. Her brother is the goalkeeper in the football team. Her cousin goes rowing on the lake. Always close your helmet strap when you ride a bike!

